    range: "",
    tooltip:
      "When your wards expire, they leave behind a Ghost Poro, which grants vision for 90s. Nearby enemy champions scare the Ghost Poro away.<br><br>Gain an <lol-uikit-tooltipped-keyword key='LinkTooltip_Description_Adaptive'><font color='#48C4B7'>adaptive</font></lol-uikit-tooltipped-keyword> bonus of 1.2 Attack Damage or 2 Ability Power for every Ghost Poro spawned and when your Ghost Poro spots an enemy champion up to 10 stacks. <br><br>After gaining 10 stacks, additionally gain 10 adaptive force.<br><hr><br>Stats Gained: <scaleAD>+@f2@ Attack Damage</scaleAD><br>Poros Spawned: @f3@<br>Enemies Spotted: @f5@",
    shortDesc:
      "When your wards expire, they leave behind a Ghost Poro. The Ghost Poro grants vision until discovered. Gain permanent AD or AP, <lol-uikit-tooltipped-keyword key='LinkTooltip_Description_Adaptive'>adaptive</lol-uikit-tooltipped-keyword> for each Ghost Poro and when your Ghost Poro spots an enemy champion, plus bonus upon completion.",
    longDesc:
      "When your wards expire, they leave behind a Ghost Poro, which grants vision for 90s. Nearby enemy champions scare the Ghost Poro away.<br><br>Gain an <lol-uikit-tooltipped-keyword key='LinkTooltip_Description_Adaptive'><font color='#48C4B7'>adaptive</font></lol-uikit-tooltipped-keyword> bonus of 1.2 Attack Damage or 2 Ability Power for every Ghost Poro spawned and when your Ghost Poro spots an enemy champion up to 10 stacks. <br><br>After gaining 10 stacks, additionally gain 10 adaptive force.",
    description:
      '<span class="template_sbc"><b>Passive:</b></span> When your <span class="glossary" data-game="lol" data-tip="Ward" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Ward" title="Ward"><img class="mw-file-element" data-file-height="72" data-file-width="72" decoding="async" height="20" loading="lazy" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Ward_icon.png/20px-Ward_icon.png?86a75" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Ward_icon.png/40px-Ward_icon.png?86a75 2x" width="20"></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Ward" title="Ward">wards</a></span> expire, they leave behind a <b>Ghost Poro</b>, which is <span class="glossary" data-game="lol" data-tip="Untargetable" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Untargetable" title="Untargetable"><img class="mw-file-element" data-file-height="64" data-file-width="64" decoding="async" height="20" loading="lazy" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/20px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/40px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c 2x" width="20"></a></span> <a class="mw-redirect" href="/en-us/Untargetable" title="Untargetable">untargetable</a></span> and grants <span class="glossary" data-game="lol" data-tip="Sight" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sight" title="Sight"><img class="mw-file-element" data-file-height="26" data-file-width="26" decoding="async" height="20" loading="lazy" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sight_icon.png/20px-Sight_icon.png?0aaf0" srcset="/en-us/images/Sight_icon.png?0aaf0 2x" width="20"></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Sight" title="Sight">sight</a></span> over the surrounding 450 units for 90 seconds. Wards destroyed by enemies or replacement do not spawn <i>Ghost Poros</i>. You can have multiple <i>Ghost Poros</i> at once.\n',
    description2:
      'Enemy <span class="glossary" data-game="lol" data-tip="Champions" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Champion" title="Champion"><img class="mw-file-element" data-file-height="200" data-file-width="200" decoding="async" height="20" loading="lazy" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/20px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/40px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0 2x" width="20"></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Champion" title="Champion">champions</a></span> that approach a <i>Ghost Poro</i> (within <span class="glossary" data-game="lol" data-tip="Er" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Range" title="Range"><img class="mw-file-element" data-file-height="480" data-file-width="480" decoding="async" height="20" loading="lazy" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_model.png/20px-Range_model.png?9f7ec" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_model.png/40px-Range_model.png?9f7ec 2x" width="20"></a></span></span> 400 center-to-edge radius) will cause it to disappear, alert its team, and grant <span class="glossary" data-game="lol" data-tip="Sight" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sight" title="Sight"><img class="mw-file-element" data-file-height="26" data-file-width="26" decoding="async" height="20" loading="lazy" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sight_icon.png/20px-Sight_icon.png?0aaf0" srcset="/en-us/images/Sight_icon.png?0aaf0 2x" width="20"></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Sight" title="Sight">sight</a></span> of a 150 radius around the triggering champion for 6 seconds.\n',
    description3:
      'Gain <span style="color:orange; white-space:normal">1.<small>2</small> <b>bonus</b> Attack Damage</span> or <span style="color: #7A6DFF; white-space:normal">2 Ability Power</span> (<a href="/en-us/Adaptive_force" title="Adaptive force">Adaptive</a>) for every <i>Ghost Poro</i> spawned and for each enemy champion spotted by a <i>Ghost Poro</i>, up to 10 stacks, for a maximum of <span style="color:orange; white-space:normal">12 <b>bonus</b> Attack Damage</span> or <span style="color: #7A6DFF; white-space:normal">20 Ability Power</span> (<a href="/en-us/Adaptive_force" title="Adaptive force">Adaptive</a>). After reaching 10 stacks, additionally gain <span style="color:orange; white-space:normal">6 <b>bonus</b> Attack Damage</span> or <span style="color: #7A6DFF; white-space:normal">10 Ability Power</span> (<a href="/en-us/Adaptive_force" title="Adaptive force">Adaptive</a>).\n',
    description4:
      '<span class="template_sbc"><b>Adaptive:</b></span> Grants bonuses in the stat you already have the most bonuses in. <i>Defaults to the first listed.</i>\n',
